    "Bis zum Ende des Probezeitraums ist alles kostenlos. Danach kostet das Jelly Jahresabo %@ pro Jahr." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Everything is free until your free trial ends. After that, the Jelly Annual Subscription costs %@ per year."
