    "Deine Bibliothek" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your Library"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Deine Mediathek wird geladen …" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loading your library …"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Deine Verbindung schafft %@ von %@ Mbit/s – es kann stocken" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Deine Verbindung schafft %1$@ von %2$@ Mbit/s – es kann stocken"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your connection manages %@ of %@ Mbit/s—playback may stutter"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Deine Wünsche" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your Requests"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "deinem Server" : {
      "comment" : "Fallback server name in 'Prüft den Weg zu …'",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "your server"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der App Store ist gerade nicht erreichbar. Bitte versuch es gleich noch einmal." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The App Store can't be reached right now. Please try again in a moment."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der Code ist abgelaufen. Bitte erneut versuchen." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The code has expired. Please try again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der Player konnte nicht gestartet werden." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The player couldn't be started."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der Server begrenzt Fernzugriffe auf %lld Mbit/s." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The server limits remote access to %lld Mbit/s."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der Server hat die Anmeldung abgelehnt. Meist ist das Geräte-Limit deines Kontos erreicht – melde ein anderes Gerät ab oder bitte den Admin, das Limit zu erhöhen." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The server rejected the sign-in. Usually your account has reached its device limit—sign out another device or ask the admin to raise the limit."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der Server hat mit Fehler %lld geantwortet." : {
      "comment" : "HTTP status code",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The server responded with error %lld."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der Server läuft über Cloudflare. Cloudflare erlaubt im kostenlosen Tarif kein großes Video-Streaming und kann drosseln – eine direkte Verbindung (z. B. per VPN wie Tailscale oder WireGuard) ist meist schneller." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The server runs through Cloudflare. Cloudflare's free plan doesn't allow large-scale video streaming and may throttle it—a direct connection (e.g. via a VPN like Tailscale or WireGuard) is usually faster."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der Server rechnet %@-mal schneller als Echtzeit um – angepasste Qualität läuft flüssig." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The server converts %@× faster than real time—adjusted quality plays smoothly."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der Server rechnet das Bild herunter" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The server lowers the video quality"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der Server rechnet nur %@-mal so schnell wie Echtzeit um – angepasste Qualität kann stocken. Hardware-Beschleunigung im Jellyfin-Dashboard hilft." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The server converts only %@× as fast as real time—adjusted quality may stutter. Turning on hardware acceleration in the Jellyfin dashboard helps."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der Server steht nicht in diesem Netzwerk" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The server isn't on this network"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der Server wird über das Internet erreicht. Die Grenze ist meist der Upload am Anschluss des Servers – mehr als dieser Upload kommt nirgends an." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The server is reached over the internet. The limit is usually the upload speed of the server's internet connection—nothing arrives faster than that upload."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der Titel liegt auf dem Jellyfin-Server, mit dem Jellyseerr verbunden ist – in deiner aktuellen Bibliothek wurde er nicht gefunden." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This title is on the Jellyfin server that Jellyseerr is connected to—it wasn't found in your current library."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Details" : {
      "localizations" : {
