        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Discover: Titles, descriptions, and images come from The Movie Database (TMDB) via your Jellyseerr server. This product uses the TMDB API but is not endorsed or certified by TMDB.\n\nJelly is an independent app and not an official product of the Jellyfin or Jellyseerr projects. The names belong to their respective projects."
